---
layout: base
title: "Packages & Pricing"
permalink: /pricing/
description: "Fixed prices for local business tech in Tampa Bay: website tune-ups, automation, launches and monthly plans. Every price is in writing before work starts."
---

{# Every price, name and inclusion below comes from src/_data/packages.js. #}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Packages &amp; pricing</p>
    <h1 class="h-section mb-4 md:text-5xl">Fixed prices, in writing, before work starts</h1>
    <p class="lede max-w-2xl">Pick a one-time project, add a monthly plan, or start with the free website write-up. You see the price first. If something changes along the way, we ask before we spend your money.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% if site.foundingClients %}
<section class="section pt-0 md:pt-0" aria-labelledby="founding-heading">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <div class="card-muted">
      <h2 id="founding-heading" class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900">Founding clients: launch prices for our first three</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">We're a new Tampa Bay firm, so we'll say it plainly: the prices below are launch prices for our first three clients. In exchange, we ask to share the before-and-after of your project as a case study. Nothing is published without your approval, and we can leave your name off. Once those three spots are filled, prices go up.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section pt-0 md:pt-0" aria-labelledby="one-time-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="one-time-heading" class="h-section mb-2">One-time projects</h2>
    <p class="mb-8 text-gray-700">You pay once. We build it, hand it over and show you how it works.</p>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for p in packages.oneTime %}
      <article id="{{ p.id }}" class="card flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col{% if p.featured %} border-2 border-gulf-600 shadow-lg{% endif %}">
        {% if p.featured %}<p class="mb-3"><span class="eyebrow bg-gulf-700 text-white">Most popular</span></p>{% endif %}
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">{{ p.name }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-900">{{ p.price }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">{{ p.priceNote }}</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-medium text-gray-900">{{ p.tagline }}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><span class="font-medium">Best for:</span> {{ p.bestFor }}</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-800">
          {% for item in p.includes %}
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">{% include "partials/check-icon.njk" %}<span>{{ item }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% if p.timeline %}<p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">{{ p.timeline }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if p.finePrint %}<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700">{{ p.finePrint }}</p>{% endif %}
        <div class="mt-auto pt-6">
          <a href="{{ p.cta.href }}" class="{% if p.featured %}btn-primary{% else %}btn-secondary{% endif %} w-full">{{ p.cta.label }}<span class="sr-only"> for {{ p.name }}</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="monthly-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="monthly-heading" class="h-section mb-2">Monthly Tech Partner plans</h2>
    <p class="mb-8 text-gray-700">One team to call for your website, your automations and your tech questions. Month-to-month, with no long-term contract.</p>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      {% for p in packages.monthly %}
      <article id="{{ p.id }}" class="card flex scroll-mt-24 flex-col{% if p.featured %} border-2 border-gulf-600 shadow-lg{% endif %}">
        {% if p.featured %}<p class="mb-3"><span class="eyebrow bg-gulf-700 text-white">Most popular</span></p>{% endif %}
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-900">{{ p.name }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-900">{{ p.price }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">{{ p.priceNote }}</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-medium text-gray-900">{{ p.tagline }}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><span class="font-medium">Best for:</span> {{ p.bestFor }}</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-800">
          {% for item in p.includes %}
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">{% include "partials/check-icon.njk" %}<span>{{ item }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% if p.timeline %}<p class="mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">{{ p.timeline }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if p.finePrint %}<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700">{{ p.finePrint }}</p>{% endif %}
        <div class="mt-auto pt-6">
          <a href="{{ p.cta.href }}" class="{% if p.featured %}btn-primary{% else %}btn-secondary{% endif %} w-full">{{ p.cta.label }}<span class="sr-only"> for {{ p.name }}</span></a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-pricing-heading">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 id="how-pricing-heading" class="h-section mb-6">How pricing works</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-800">
      {% for term in packages.terms %}
      <li class="flex items-start gap-3">{% include "partials/check-icon.njk" %}<span>{{ term }}</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pt-0 md:pt-0" aria-labelledby="not-sure-heading">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <div class="card-muted">
      <h2 id="not-sure-heading" class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900">Not sure which one you need?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">Start with the free checkup. We look at your website, your booking flow and your Google listing, then tell you what to fix first. It might be a small tune-up. It might be nothing we sell. You get the answer either way.</p>
      <p class="mt-5"><a href="{{ site.writeupCta.href }}" class="btn-primary">Get my free website write-up</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section band-dark on-dark text-center">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium text-white md:text-4xl">Start with a free look at your tech</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-gray-100">A 20-minute call and a written report. No cost, no pressure. We reply within {{ site.responseTime }}.</p>
    <p class="mt-8"><a href="{{ site.writeupCta.href }}" class="btn-light">Get my free website write-up</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
